{"version":1,"content":"<p>Google近日宣佈擴展其人工智能晶片產品線，推出兩款專門面向不同應用場景打造的新型張量處理單元（TPU），分別命名為TPU 8tx和TPU 8i Max。這兩款產品基於Google現有第八代TPU架構開發，旨在滿足企業客户對於數據安全和大規模人工智能推理任務不斷增長的需求。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1585646.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-10T12:20:23.388361+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":143,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-09T15:23:54+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-10T12:13:47.084728+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-10T12:13:47.084728+00:00","content_hash":"024f11113284792b0f43671cffcb14a573b67353d1227e7e9beac3c953f8863e","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}